Rule 135 (Check dilation values when it's a tuple, all values must be greater than 0)
{dilation : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, dilation.len - 1] : dilation[i] > 0
>>
Rule 136 (Check stride values when it's a tuple, all values must be greater than 0)
{stride : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, stride.len - 1] : stride[i] > 0
>>
Rule 137 (Check padding values when it's a tuple, all values must be >= 0)
{padding : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, padding.len - 1] : padding[i] ≥ 0
>>
